1
00:00:02,391 --> 00:00:05,805
Namaskaar doston, aur swagat hai aapka is channel par.

2
00:00:06,935 --> 00:00:17,090
Aaj hum banayenge ek complete, professional Sales MIS Report — bilkul usi tarah jaise companies mein MIS executives banate hain.

3
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:28,546
MIS ka matlab hai Management Information System — raw data ko aise summarise karna ki management ek nazar mein decision le sake.

4
00:00:29,676 --> 00:00:39,276
Video ke end tak aapke paas hoga ek live dashboard — KPIs, region aur product analysis, Pivot Tables, charts aur slicers.

5
00:00:40,406 --> 00:00:45,762
Main sirf dikhaunga nahi, har formula samjhaunga bhi. Toh chaliye shuru karte hain!

6
00:00:46,892 --> 00:00:56,003
Sabse pehle data samajhte hain. Yeh Raw_Data sheet hai — isme October 2026 ki 180 transactions hain.

7
00:00:57,133 --> 00:01:04,451
Date invoice ki tareekh hai, Invoice No har bill ka unique number, aur Region — East, West, North ya South.

8
00:01:05,581 --> 00:01:12,408
Phir Salesperson, Product — Tea A, Tea B ya Tea C, Qty yaani kitne units bike, aur Unit Price.

9
00:01:13,538 --> 00:01:21,433
Sales Amount abhi khaali hai — ise hum formula se bharenge. Aur Payment Status batata hai — Paid ya Pending.

10
00:01:22,563 --> 00:01:34,769
Shortcut: Ctrl + ↓ — cursor seedha aakhri row 182 par. Yaani header ke neeche 180 data rows.

11
00:01:35,899 --> 00:01:45,543
Important: ek row = ek unique invoice. Har Invoice No bhara hua hai aur kabhi repeat nahi hota.

12
00:01:46,673 --> 00:01:57,192
Ab is data ko Excel Table mein convert karte hain — formulas readable bante hain aur range apne aap expand hoti hai.

13
00:01:58,322 --> 00:02:02,525
Data ke kisi bhi cell par click karke Ctrl + T dabaiye.

14
00:02:03,655 --> 00:02:14,005
Create Table mein range =$A$2:$I$182 aa gayi. 'My table has headers' tick hona chahiye — phir OK.

15
00:02:15,135 --> 00:02:24,033
Table ban gaya — banded rows, har header par filter button, aur ribbon mein Table Design tab.

16
00:02:25,163 --> 00:02:32,738
Table Name box mein likhiye SalesData aur Enter. Yahi naam aage har formula mein use hoga.

17
00:02:33,868 --> 00:02:43,043
Ab Sales Amount. Table ke andar formulas structured references use karte hain — cell address nahi, column ka naam.

18
00:02:44,173 --> 00:02:54,307
H3 mein type kijiye: =[@Qty]*[@[Unit Price]]

19
00:02:55,437 --> 00:03:04,079
@ ka matlab — isi row ki value. Unit Price do shabdon ka naam hai, isliye uske around double brackets.

20
00:03:05,209 --> 00:03:12,847
Enter dabaate hi formula poore column mein apne aap fill — saari 180 rows ek saath.

21
00:03:13,977 --> 00:03:27,013
Check: row 3 mein 55 × 120.00 = 6,600.00 ✔. Column select karein toh status bar mein Sum: 1,428,190.00.

22
00:03:28,143 --> 00:03:35,910
Ab dashboard ka dil — KPI cards. Yaad rakhiye, final values kabhi haath se type nahi karte.

23
00:03:37,040 --> 00:03:42,864
Sab kuch formula se aata hai — data badla, toh number apne aap update.

24
00:03:43,994 --> 00:03:59,058
Total Sales (B6): SUMIFS sirf October ka Sales Amount jodta hai — date range DATE() se di hai.

25
00:04:00,188 --> 00:04:04,284
Result: 1,428,190.00 — yaani chaudah lakh, atthais hazaar, ek sau nabbe.

26
00:04:05,414 --> 00:04:15,593
Total Orders (D6): ek row = ek invoice, isliye COUNTIFS se October ke non-blank invoices — 180.

27
00:04:16,723 --> 00:04:25,366
Total Units Sold (F6): wahi date condition, Qty ka SUMIFS — 11,834.

28
00:04:26,496 --> 00:04:41,198
Average Sales / Order (H6): =IFERROR(B6/D6,0) — orders zero hon toh bhi error nahi. Result 7,934.39.

29
00:04:42,328 --> 00:04:54,534
Pending Sales Amount (B9): Payment Status = "Pending" wala SUMIFS — 372,985.00.

30
00:04:55,664 --> 00:05:07,783
Naam jaan-boojhkar Pending Sales Amount rakha hai, 'Outstanding Receivables' nahi — data mein payment received ya balance ki field hi nahi hai.

31
00:05:08,913 --> 00:05:15,571
Ab region-wise analysis — management dekhna chahta hai kaunsa region aage hai.

32
00:05:16,701 --> 00:05:28,393
C13 mein wahi SUMIFS + ek condition: SalesData[Region] = B13. Region cell se aata hai, isliye formula neeche copy ho jaata hai.

33
00:05:29,523 --> 00:05:47,234
East 351,030 • West 383,675 (sabse strong) • North 355,130 • South 338,355.

34
00:05:48,364 --> 00:05:57,667
Total (C17) = 1,428,190.00 — bilkul Total Sales ke barabar. Yahi hamara cross-check hai ✔

35
00:05:58,797 --> 00:06:09,551
Isi tarah Product-wise: Tea A 385,320 • Tea B 432,820 • Tea C 610,050 — total phir se 1,428,190.00 ✔

36
00:06:10,681 --> 00:06:16,463
Formulas ke saath Pivot Table bhi seekhte hain — drag-and-drop se instant summary.

37
00:06:17,593 --> 00:06:24,463
SalesData ke kisi cell par click → Insert → PivotTable → From Table/Range.

38
00:06:25,593 --> 00:06:32,123
Table/Range mein SalesData already aa gaya. New Worksheet choose karke OK.

39
00:06:33,253 --> 00:06:43,921
Nayi sheet bani — right side PivotTable Fields. Region ko Rows mein, Sales Amount ko Values mein drag kijiye.

40
00:06:45,051 --> 00:06:55,165
Dhyaan: Values mein Sum of Sales Amount hona chahiye. 'Count of' dikhe toh → Value Field Settings → Sum.

41
00:06:56,295 --> 00:07:07,369
Date ko Filters mein daaliye, October 2026 rakhiye. Grand Total = 1428190 — dashboard se match ✔

42
00:07:08,499 --> 00:07:14,729
Isi tarah doosra pivot — Product Rows mein, Sales Amount Values mein.

43
00:07:15,859 --> 00:07:21,470
Ab charts — visuals se management ko baat turant samajh aati hai.

44
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:30,088
Region pivot select → PivotTable Analyze → PivotChart → Clustered Column → OK.

45
00:07:31,218 --> 00:07:42,186
Chart aa gaya. Right-click → Add Data Labels — har bar par exact value. Title: Region-wise Sales Performance.

46
00:07:43,316 --> 00:07:52,620
Product pivot ke liye Pie chart — Product-wise Sales Analysis. Tea C ka share sabse bada.

47
00:07:53,750 --> 00:07:57,974
Ab report ko interactive banate hain — slicers se.

48
00:07:59,104 --> 00:08:06,251
Pivot select → PivotTable Analyze → Insert Slicer → Region aur Product tick → OK.

49
00:08:07,381 --> 00:08:17,899
Ek slicer se dono pivots: slicer par right-click → Report Connections → dono PivotTables tick.

50
00:08:19,029 --> 00:08:26,240
Yaad rakhiye: slicer sirf same data source (SalesData) wale pivots ko jod sakta hai.

51
00:08:27,370 --> 00:08:33,536
Ab West par click — dono pivots aur charts turant West ke liye filter ho gaye!

52
00:08:34,666 --> 00:08:41,173
Filter hatane ke liye slicer ka Clear Filter button — totals wapas poore.

53
00:08:42,303 --> 00:08:49,707
Ab finishing — professional dashboard ka matlab decoration nahi, clarity.

54
00:08:50,837 --> 00:08:59,883
Bold title, KPI cards ka consistent colour, aur numbers par thousands separator — Ctrl + Shift + 1.

55
00:09:01,013 --> 00:09:06,453
View tab → Gridlines untick — look ekdum clean.

56
00:09:07,583 --> 00:09:15,329
Ek font, consistent spacing, do-teen colours — report manager ke liye hai, readability sabse upar.

57
00:09:16,459 --> 00:09:23,307
Report tab tak bharosemand nahi jab tak refresh aur validation na ho.

58
00:09:24,437 --> 00:09:32,715
Raw_Data mein nayi row aaye — Table hone se SUMIFS / COUNTIFS use apne aap pakad lete hain.

59
00:09:33,845 --> 00:09:42,421
Pivot Tables ko refresh karna padta hai: Data → Refresh All — ya Ctrl + Alt + F5.

60
00:09:43,551 --> 00:09:52,725
Teen cross-check: Region total = Product total = Pivot Grand Total = Total Sales 1,428,190.

61
00:09:53,855 --> 00:09:58,677
Teeno match ✔ — report reconciled.

62
00:09:59,807 --> 00:10:04,927
Toh doston, aaj humne zero se ek complete Sales MIS Report banayi.

63
00:10:06,057 --> 00:10:16,169
Excel Table, structured formula, SUMIFS / COUNTIFS KPIs, region-product analysis, Pivot, charts aur slicers.

64
00:10:17,299 --> 00:10:25,877
Aur sabse zaroori — har number ko validate kiya. Yahi aapko professional MIS executive banata hai.

65
00:10:27,007 --> 00:10:38,763
Video achhi lagi toh Like, Subscribe aur comment mein agla topic bataiye. Happy Excel-ing!
